WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.647
It was risky to attempt to reach Shanghai in that season of the year.

2
00:00:05.648 --> 00:00:11.117
The Chinese seas were dangerous and terrible storms threatened during November.

3
00:00:11.118 --> 00:00:18.195
But John Bunsby believed in the Tankadere , which, in his words, "rode the waves like a

4
00:00:18.196 --> 00:00:23.107
seagull." Late in the day, Fogg and the others sailed out through the channels of Hong

5
00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:28.541
Kong. The Tankadere , encouraged by favorable winds, conducted

6
