itself admirably. John Bunsby had high hopes for the journey and assured Mr. Fogg that they would reach Shanghai

7
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:44.072
in time. When they got into open sea, Phileas Fogg said, "Captain, I'm sure that I do not need to ask you to use all

8
